WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:01.126
It wasn't about the fashion.

00:00:01.918 --> 00:00:02.919
It was about the women.

00:00:03.378 --> 00:00:04.963
That's what a super model is.

00:00:10.719 --> 00:00:11.886
It's the first time

00:00:11.886 --> 00:00:12.971
we're all together

00:00:12.971 --> 00:00:13.972
in our fifties.

00:00:15.724 --> 00:00:17.100
You see our photos.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.852
So you feel that you know us.

00:00:20.145 --> 00:00:22.981
When you come together
with your choosen family

00:00:22.981 --> 00:00:24.065
I think that's emotional.

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:26.484
There is something about

00:00:26.484 --> 00:00:28.695
that shared history that
we have.

00:00:30.321 --> 00:00:33.283
I feel blessed that
we're here today.

00:00:34.492 --> 00:00:36.077
We've all gone through
some many

00:00:36.077 --> 00:00:37.412
things in our own lives.

00:00:40.707 --> 00:00:41.583
Cindy,

00:00:41.583 --> 00:00:42.375
Linda,

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:43.001
Christy and

00:00:43.001 --> 00:00:43.752
Naomi

00:00:43.752 --> 00:00:46.212
are still redefining what
it means to be a model.

00:00:48.923 --> 00:00:50.425
There was a feeling
about them

00:00:50.425 --> 00:00:52.677
that they 
wanted more.

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:55.930
I was not seen as
a person who had

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:58.266
a voice in her own destiny.

00:00:58.641 --> 00:01:00.518
He said you should lose
five pounds.

00:01:00.518 --> 00:01:02.395
I got scared I didn't
belong.

00:01:02.812 --> 00:01:04.314
But Linda's a chameleon.

00:01:04.314 --> 00:01:06.649
She could really
become whatever

00:01:06.649 --> 00:01:08.693
the photographer wanted
her to become.

00:01:08.693 --> 00:01:10.695
I would do all these
great shows,

00:01:10.695 --> 00:01:12.363
wear all these
beautiful dresses

00:01:12.363 --> 00:01:14.324
but then when it come
time for the advertising

00:01:14.324 --> 00:01:15.950
and I would not
be included.

00:01:16.326 --> 00:01:17.535
I was gonna be bullied

00:01:17.535 --> 00:01:18.661
for the color of my skin.

00:01:19.037 --> 00:01:20.872
What I loved about
the girls,

00:01:20.872 --> 00:01:21.998
they were a group

00:01:21.998 --> 00:01:24.209
and that was so fabulous.

00:01:24.417 --> 00:01:25.376
We were always together

00:01:25.376 --> 00:01:27.253
and we made great
photos together.

00:01:27.253 --> 00:01:28.087
You know I just felt like

00:01:28.087 --> 00:01:29.255
 to be together as a group,

00:01:29.255 --> 00:01:30.757
it just was so fun.

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:32.634
They're my sisters.

00:01:33.426 --> 00:01:34.719
We get this phone call

00:01:34.719 --> 00:01:36.930
that George Michael wants to
shoot us in his video.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:37.931
We made a decision.

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:38.973
I will do it.

00:01:38.973 --> 00:01:39.599
I'm going to do it.

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:40.558
Yes, okay, I'll do it.

00:01:40.558 --> 00:01:42.227
♫ Freedom ♫

00:01:42.227 --> 00:01:43.436
Everything changed.

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:44.813
You can start to call
the shots

00:01:44.813 --> 00:01:46.439
and be an active participant

00:01:46.439 --> 00:01:47.232
in your career.

00:01:47.232 --> 00:01:48.358
All of a sudden,

00:01:48.358 --> 00:01:50.610
we were the physical
representations

00:01:50.610 --> 00:01:51.402
of power.

00:01:51.402 --> 00:01:53.947
I wanted to go further,
I wanted to push the envelope.

00:01:55.532 --> 00:01:58.201
They brought their
artistry to the image.

00:01:58.201 --> 00:01:59.410
They would see things

00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:00.662
we didn't necessarily see.

00:02:00.745 --> 00:02:02.121
They're like the Mona Lisa.

00:02:02.121 --> 00:02:03.498
The face of her era.

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:04.791
They're larger than life.

00:02:04.791 --> 00:02:06.000
♫ Freedom ♫

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:08.211
We helped break 
down barriers.

00:02:08.211 --> 00:02:10.505
I have to think of something
greather than myself.

00:02:10.755 --> 00:02:13.049
When I first was referred to
as a supermodel,

00:02:13.049 --> 00:02:15.176
I was like why are they
calling us this.

00:02:16.094 --> 00:02:18.012
It wasn't about the hair
and the make-up.

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:19.848
It wasn't about the fashion.

00:02:20.682 --> 00:02:21.850
It was about the women.

00:02:21.850 --> 00:02:23.852
♫

00:02:23.852 --> 00:02:25.645
That's what a supermodel is.

